 *
 * @note Output is printed to stdout as a sequence of integers separated by tabs.
 * @note This is a recursive traversal with O(n) time complexity.
 */
Dependencies: postorder_display

FUNCTION IMPLEMENTATION (REFERENCE ONLY - do NOT copy into test):
```c
